{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "45c63a18-3e0b-8961-a875-605e6ffafdc4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-23T09:08:21-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilza Fortes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:02:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:02:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Yes, good morning. Is this Public Works? You'll have to talk up a little, I'm hard of hearing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:02:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, Public Works, Kevin speaking. How can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:02:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Kevin. My name is Nilza Fortes. I'm calling about the pothole on my mother's street. She's in her eighties and she doesn't do the phone anymore, so I do it for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:02:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no problem. What street is the pothole on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:02:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What? Say that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:03:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What street is it on? The pothole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:03:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, the street. Hang on, I'm putting you on the speaker... no, that's worse. Okay. It's Dearborn Court, it's the little one off the main road. Dearborn Court."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dearborn Court, got it. I'm writing that down. And what's going on with the hole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:03:24-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's the thing. Somebody came last week and filled it. The cold patch, they call it? Black stuff, dumped in the hole. And it's gone. Washed right out. It lasted, what, four days? Now the hole's back and it's bigger than before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:03:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. So it was patched last week and the patch didn't hold. Let me put that in. Cold patch, washed out, hole is bigger now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:03:55-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bigger. Yes. Pieces of it are all over the road, little gravel bits in the gutter. I mean, why even bother, you know? Drive out, shovel it in, drive away. Then it rains and poof."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:04:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the cold patch is a temporary fix, especially with the freezing and thawing this time of year. It doesn't take much to pop it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:04:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's temporary all right. Very temporary. Four days!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:04:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Fair enough. Is it in the middle of the road or along the edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:04:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The what? Edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:04:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is the hole in the middle of the road, or over by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:04:44-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, it's more toward the middle. Right where you come in off the main road, you have to go around it or you're in it. And my neighbor hit it. Across the street, Mr. Medeiros. He hit it on Sunday and he said he's got a wobble in the front end now. He's going to have it looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:05:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Okay, I'll note that a neighbor hit it too and had possible vehicle damage. Did he report it to anybody, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:05:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't think so. He just complains to me. Everybody complains to me, I'm the one who calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:05:31-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[crosstalk] Ha, well, somebody's got to. Right, so what I've got is Dearborn Court, near where it meets the main road, the patch from last week washed out, and a neighbor hit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:05:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it exactly. So what I'm asking is, can you put the street on the repair list? The real list. Not the shovel-and-go list. Proper repair."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:05:58-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can add it to the list for crews to look at, yeah. I'll flag that it's a repeat, that the temporary patch already failed. That helps it get seen as something more than a quick fill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:06:14-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Good. Because I don't want to be calling again after Christmas. My mother's going to want to go out for her appointments and I'd like her not to be bounced around in the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:06:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Crews are going to be stretched this week with the holiday, so I won't promise you a day. But it's on the list as of this call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:06:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What was that? The line, it's a little [line breaks up] hard to hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:06:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said it's on the list as of right now. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:06:57-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, now I can. Okay. I'm sorry, I'm in the hallway at work and I'm trying to keep it down. My boss doesn't like personal calls on the floor, so I came out by the stairwell. It echoes, and I talk loud already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, take your time. Do you want me to have somebody call you back once it's scheduled, or are you good to just watch for the crew?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:07:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call me back, please. Better. Let me give you my number. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:07:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-seven. Got it. And that's Nilza, N-I-L-Z-A?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:07:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Fortes, F-O-R-T-E-S. Like the Portuguese, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fortes, got it. So Nilza Fortes calling for her mother, Dearborn Court, failed cold patch near the main road entrance, neighbor damage, requesting it be added to the repair list, callback at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:08:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. You read that back better than my own children would. Okay, thank you. I'd better get back in before somebody wonders where I went."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:08:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Happy holidays, Nilza. Tell your mom we'll get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T09:08:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Bye now."
    }
  ],
